  "body": "Don't compromise on quality-experience comfort and affordability with this modern, well-crafted standalone home. Thoughtfully designed with a modern layout and high-quality materials, this brand-new property is perfect for first-home buyers or savvy investors.\r\n\r\n-4 spacious bedrooms, including a master ensuite\r\n-2 stylish bathrooms\r\n-Thoughtfully allocated study/entertaining area\r\n-Open-plan kitchen with premium appliances\r\n-Seamless flow to low-maintenance outdoor spaces \r\n-internal-access garage \r\n\r\nOffering three spacious bedrooms, including a master ensuite, alongside 2 stylish bathrooms, this home provides plenty of room for the whole family. A thoughtfully allocated study/entertaining area, an open-plan kitchen fitted with premium appliances, and a spacious living area ensure you have all the space you need. The seamless flow to low-maintenance outdoor areas adds to the family-friendly appeal. Plus, the convenience of a single internal-access garage completes the package.\r\n\r\nConveniently located near motorways, local amenities, and malls, this home offers the perfect blend of lifestyle and practicality.",
